---
import { PiUsersThree, PiBuildings } from 'react-icons/pi';

// No props needed for this static section
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-24">
  <!-- Subtle Background Gradient for depth -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 -left-64 -z-10 h-[500px] w-[500px] -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-primary/5 blur-3xl"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24 items-center">
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h2
          class="font-display fill-mode-both animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight uppercase duration-700 md:text-4xl"
        >
          <span class="text-foreground">The </span>
          <span class="bg-linear-to-br from-primary to-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >Founding Story</span
          >
        </h2>

        <div
          class="space-y-6 text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed fill-mode-both animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-6 delay-200 duration-700"
        >
          <p>
            BDKinc was founded in 1999 with a singular directive: to bridge the
            gap between complex enterprise technology and the businesses that
            rely on it. In an era where "IT support" often meant reactive fixes,
            our founders envisioned a practice built on <strong
              class="text-foreground font-semibold">precision engineering</strong
            >—where systems are architected for resilience, not just repaired
            after failure.
          </p>

          <p>
            We rejected the transactional vendor model from day one. Instead, we
            established a <strong class="text-foreground font-semibold"
              >high-touch partnership</strong
            > philosophy. We operate as a premier extension of your leadership team,
            bringing the technical discipline required to navigate shifting digital
            landscapes. Our goal isn't just to manage servers, but to own the outcomes
            that drive your growth.
          </p>

          <p>
            Today, that vision remains our core protocol. We combine the agility
            of a specialized boutique with the capabilities of a global
            powerhouse. Whether modernizing legacy infrastructure or deploying
            cutting-edge AI, we stand as <strong
              class="text-foreground font-semibold"
              >partners in your potential</strong
            >, ensuring every technical decision advances your strategic
            mission.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual/Image Placeholder -->
      <div
        class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-lg lg:max-w-none fill-mode-both animate-in fade-in zoom-in delay-300 duration-700"
      >
        <!-- The Card -->
        <div
          class="glass border-border group relative aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border shadow-2xl"
        >
          <!-- Inner Gradient/Background -->
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-primary/5 via-background to-secondary/5"
          >
          </div>

          <!-- Placeholder Content -->
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 p-8 text-center"
          >
            <div
              class="rounded-full bg-muted/50 p-6 ring-1 ring-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm"
            >
              <PiUsersThree className="h-12 w-12 text-muted-foreground/50" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div
                class="text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground/60"
              >
                Founding Partners
              </div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground/40">
                1999 - Present
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hover Effect Overlay -->
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"
          >
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Caption/Tagline below image -->
        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground/60">
            <PiBuildings className="h-4 w-4" />
            <span>Est. 1999 • Maryland Eastern Shore</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
